  "lesson": "## Transformer cuts on the crossfader\n\nCrossfader hard left to right on every beat and back on every off-beat, for 4 bars at 100 BPM. Set the crossfader curve to sharp in rekordbox first, or the cut is a fade. This is the entry to scratching: the hand learns to move the fader as a switch, not a slider.\n",
